@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Keep the search index current
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Backend — Logos Lab Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "SearchIndexUpdateJob" as SearchIndexUpdateJob
  participant "SearchDocumentRepository" as SearchDocumentRepository
end box
box "Backend — Logos Lab Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  queue "Job queue" as queue
  database "Logos Lab database" as db
end box
queue -> SearchIndexUpdateJob : Deliver message for contentId after publish, revise, archive or hide
SearchIndexUpdateJob -> db : Load item, workflow state, publish time and hidden flag
db --> SearchIndexUpdateJob : Item state
alt item is published and not hidden
  SearchIndexUpdateJob -> SearchDocumentRepository : upsert(title, summary, body, transcript, topics, expert names)
  SearchDocumentRepository -> db : Upsert search_documents row with unaccented vector
else draft, scheduled, archived or hidden
  SearchIndexUpdateJob -> SearchDocumentRepository : remove(contentId) (L2-003)
  SearchDocumentRepository -> db : Delete search_documents row
end
db --> SearchDocumentRepository : Commit
SearchDocumentRepository --> SearchIndexUpdateJob : Done
SearchIndexUpdateJob --> queue : Acknowledge (idempotent; retried with backoff)
@enduml
